course: dictionary
lesson: 7157
title: Performer
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: A performer is a person who entertains an audience. They might act, sing, dance, play music or do tricks, on a stage, in a street or in a circus. «Stunt performers are trained professionals who rehearse with safety teams» tells you that performers practise a lot before they perform.
explain: The word has a second meaning too: a person or thing that does well or badly at something. «A top performer» is someone who does something very well, and the word top gives you the clue. When you meet an unknown word, look at the words around it.
explain: Test your meaning by putting it into the sentence. «A stunt double is a trained stunt performer who stands in for an actor» still makes sense if you read performer as a person who entertains an audience. So your meaning is right.
fact: Performer is a noun. One performer, many performers.
fact: «Performer» means a person who entertains an audience by acting, singing, dancing, playing music or doing tricks.
fact: «Stage fright» means fear of performing. Many famous performers say they still get it, and it often fades once they start.
fact: «Heckle» means shouting comments at a performer.
fact: «Mime» means acting out a song without really singing it, so one mimed song does not prove that a singer cannot sing.
exercise: What does performer mean? | *A person who entertains an audience | A person who cleans the stage | A seat in a theatre | A loud type of music
exercise: Lily says, «She is a top performer at chess.» What does top performer mean here? | A person who does something very badly | A person who only plays the piano | A person who sits at the top of the stage | *A person who does something very well
exercise: «Stage fright is fear of performing.» Find and copy the phrase that names this fear. | *stage fright | circus | audience | rehearse
test: What does heckle mean? | To clap loudly for a performer | To sing very softly | To hide from a performer | *To shout comments at a performer
test: Which of these is a street performer? | A bus driver | A shop assistant | A librarian | *A juggler on a busy pavement
exam: Which phrase means someone who does something very well? | stage fright | a mimed song | *a top performer | a street performer
